Youth Chair, Vice-Chair, Secretary and Communications Director-

My name is John Rembao and I am the Director of Operations for Cal Track &
Field.  In the past, when we had hosted our All Comers Meets, we allowed
youth to participate in our meets.  Due to many factors, this year we will
only allow athletes *13 and older* to participate in our All Comer Meets.
 It was my hope that you could pass this information on to your constituent
clubs so that they do not unnecessarily make the trip to Cal on our All
Comer dates, but also to inform athletes who are 13 and older of the
opportunity to participate at Cal on the Saturdays of January 15, February 5
and February 19th.   I have attached a schedule if you would like to post or
email this information to interested clubs.

Thank you for your consideration.

Sincerely,

John Rembao


